{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t衞生防護中心過去一星期，錄得兩宗外地傳入的登革熱感染個案，兩名病人於潛伏期內分別到過印度及孟加拉。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n本港今年暫時累計錄得36宗登革熱個案，包括34宗外地傳入及兩宗本地感染個案。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n另外，中心沒有錄得新增基孔肯雅熱感染個案。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:43:52.239057+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:17:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:38.182309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:17.434495+00:00","content_hash":"e3f6e0adebd36edfff90952f8ecc6057518157356645286dbc5ace1b8048404c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}